00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:16.620
This is going to be
the input to the model.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:18.295
Then I choose the output.

00:19:18.295 --> 00:19:19.670
These are the
columns in the data

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.240
